@base = http://localhost:8080

### List events
GET {{base}}/api/events

### Seat map (AVAILABLE / HELD / BOOKED)
GET {{base}}/api/events/1/seats

### 1. Hold seat 5 for 10 minutes (expect 201)
# @name hold
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "eventId": 1, "seatIds": [5] }

### 2. Try to hold the same seat again (expect 409 "currently held")
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "eventId": 1, "seatIds": [5] }

### 3. Look at the hold (expect 200 with secondsRemaining)
GET {{base}}/api/reservations/{{hold.response.body.id}}?userId=1

### 4a. Confirm the hold into a booking (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservationId": "{{hold.response.body.id}}", "userId": 1 }

### 4b. ...or cancel instead (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/api/reservations/{{hold.response.body.id}}?userId=1

### My bookings
GET {{base}}/api/bookings?userId=1

### Unknown event (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/api/events/999
